        "original_id": "f0281f1c-f31b-50e9-835f-bf7521fd11d9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: 20th Century Fox\n- Products: The Ghost and Mrs. Muir, The Ghost and Mr. Chicken\n- Places: United Kingdom, Century City, Los Angeles, Beverly Hills\n- Concepts: Big Six major American film studios, film rights\n\nFacts:\n- In 1945, 20th Century Fox bought the film rights to the novel The Ghost and Mrs. Muir, which at that time had been published only in the United Kingdom.\n- In 1947, the film The Ghost and Mrs. Muir was released.\n- 20th Century Fox is one of the Big Six major American film studios.\n- 20th Century Fox is located in the Century City area of Los Angeles, just west of Beverly Hills.\n- The title The Ghost and Mr. Chicken is presumably a humorous variation of the film title The Ghost and Mrs. Muir.",
